WEBVTT

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.710
I can see it! Look, look!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.130
The ocean!

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.260
Yeah, how super beautiful it is!

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.380
Oh Ruri, thank you!

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.050
I can't believe we get to ride
in such a luxurious car!

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.060
This year's club camp
is going to be amazing!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.480
Well, it's the least I can do
as a stone club member.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.020
Wakana, what kind of bathing suit
did you bring?

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.070
What do you mean?
I'm brought my usual school one.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.650
Really. No way!

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.530
Alma.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.070
What?

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.370
Why are you blushing?

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.080
What? Nothing!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.120
Miss Ruri.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.410
Local preparations are complete.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.630
All is taken care of here.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.710
Please enjoy your time
at the club camp.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.600
Club camp with Alma.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.190
We'll be at our destination soon.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:05.400
OK, oni!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.820
This is where you come to
pay respect to the stone gods.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:44.870
The shrine is very popular
among the stone lovers.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:48.290
Wakana has been so adamant
about coming here.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.790
I figured it was
something like that.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:54.210
The object of worship is
a really good looking stone!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.210
Also... look!

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.840
That mountain over there.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:04.180
There's a theory that in ancient times people created
that pyramid to worship the stone gods.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.930
I don't think so.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.690
So, there's some truth to it!

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.940
The hearts of those who love stones...

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.940
are universal!

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:18.700
What? No, the pyramids were not created
because the Egyptians loved stones.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.200
The pyramids.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.780
Come to think of it,
you could see it that way.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.790
Alma?

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.420
Oh, it's nothing.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.640
Here you go!

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:47.720
Quit that. It's cold!

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.640
This feels nice.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:50.890
Stop it!

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:52.650
Here's more!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:59.650
Oh, this one's a keeper!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.900
This one too!

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.410
So many beautiful stones!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.700
I just can't decide!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.620
I sense there are some
good ones over there.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.510
WOW!

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.480
Tandoji! Are the charcoals ready?

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:44.820
How's this?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.870
Do you feel something?

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:51.660
There's no doubt about it, oni.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.830
Like you said, it's around this area.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.330
Tandoji!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.840
What are you doing?

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:00.840
Come on Ruri, play with us.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:01.840
Yeah, let's go.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.550
You feel a Dark Stone?

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:05.380
Are you sure?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:09.470
It's not just looking our way.
I sense it's hunting us.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:14.850
The Dark Stones have been in this world
long before humans realized their existence, oni.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:18.520
There must be old
Dark Stones here, oni.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.900
I don't know what type
they are yet, oni.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.530
Tandoji!

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:27.870
Can I borrow you for a sec?

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.920
Hey!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.960
Hey, what's this?

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.840
I found this while
I was collecting stones.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.050
This might be an entrance
to the legendary pyramid!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.880
What? For real?

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.390
How about it?

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:50.930
I sense it.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.930
I think this is it.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.940
Alright, let's go take a look.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.940
Seriously?

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.730
Stop. You can't go unprepared.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.740
Oh, come on. I just want
to see a little more.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.780
The meat is almost done.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.580
How about we continue this
after we eat.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.540
Are you sure you'll be
OK by yourself?

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.500
I'm just going to
check out the situation.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:23.920
If I can't handle it,
I'll come straight back.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.970
Miss Ruri, please don't worry
and enjoy your club camp.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:30.430
I'm going with him, so you have
nothing to worry about, oni.

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:33.970
This time the development team's
newest device is on board.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:39.560
The Corundum laser cannon,
a single-shot deal that guarantees results.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:43.440
But please ensure the safety
of the perimeter before use.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.900
Yeah, if you don't pay attention,
it'll take out the whole cave.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.450
Only a newcomer like you
would make such a mistake.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.620
What?

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:57.710
It's with great hesitation that
I'm allowing you to look after Miss Ruri.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.630
But I've got to
let it go this time.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:04.800
Guard Miss Ruri and the stone club
members with your life!

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.720
I don't need you to tell me that,
I already know.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:15.430
You'd better. If I see one little cut
on Miss Ruri, I'm coming after you.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.980
Whatever. You'd better make sure
you don't get lost in the cave.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.150
Oni!

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.150
Soil composition, stratal structure,
magnetic field, gravity survey.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.980
Analysis, 58% complete.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:32.780
Current location verified. 157m from entrance.
Maintaining communication line.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.950
Mr. Kagami! Can you hear me?

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.830
Copy, I can hear you.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.540
Going in.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.920
<i>Yes sir, commence exploration.</i>

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:49.670
We've got a long way to go, oni.
The Dark Stone's still far off, oni.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.850
There are traces
it's been altered.

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:02.940
It doesn't appear to be
a natural cave.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.190
Can it really be
an ancient pyramid?

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:10.030
Wouldn't it be better
if we had Alma with us, oni?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.820
It would have put a damper
on Miss Ruri's club camp.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.030
So you're going to play
a thankless role, oni?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.620
That's my job.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:25.960
You poser! I always thought, oni,
that you're some kind of--

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:26.960
Oni!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.500
What happened?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.050
It's here, oni!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.600
Target Dark Stone confirmed!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.190
Opening fire!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.280
Oooh, that's hot. Hot!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.820
Yummy!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:57.740
Um, this is out of this world. My it's good!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:02.120
Hey, where's Kagami?

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.120
Toilet break?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:06.960
No, he had Aiba business
he needed to attend to.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:10.050
That's too bad.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:22.100
Is that it? Any sign of a Dark Stone?

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:27.270
Almost gone, but there remains
some in the back, oni.

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:30.070
So that's the boss.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.320
It's smack in the middle
of the mountain, oni.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.610
It doesn't appear to be moving, oni.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:38.120
It's probably not that strong, b-but...

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:40.280
What, oni? What's this sensation?

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.120
Current depth?

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.120
<i>58m underground.</i>

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:53.050
<i>Currently, thermal response, magnetic responses, sonic response are all normal.</i>

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.930
We should go in
and check it out.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.100
Oni!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.980
What's going on?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.230
Oh my!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:08.980
Everyone OK?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:09.980
It can't be!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.820
Hey, wait!

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.610
Hold on!

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.860
This might be caused by something
other than a Dark Stone.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.030
But the timing!

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:40.010
What-what's happening?

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:41.180
The Dark Stone, oni!

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.850
This power is a
different level, oni!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:45.810
Has it awoken?

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.230
<i>Emergency situation.</i>

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:50.690
<i>Miss Ruri and Tandoji have fallen into a massive sinkhole.</i>

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.270
<i>They're now inside the cave!</i>

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.270
What?

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:56.690
<i>We're currently running a trace on the tracking device on Miss Ruri.</i>

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.740
<i>We 're. - - locating.</i>

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.330
Operator! Come in!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.750
I'm heading out to locate Miss Ruri.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.370
Oni-gawara, can you locate her?

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.000
I think I can, oni.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.380
I have a bad feeling
about this, uni!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.010
Tandoji...

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:24.970
What on earth are you doing?

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.370
Miss Ruri?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.240
Can you hear me?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.330
Hey!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.960
Uh, what is that?

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:28.040
<i>I don't need you to tell me that, I already know.</i>

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.290
What am I doing?

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.450
Wow, what just happened?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.490
I was so shocked.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:08.160
For safety's sake, seek shelter.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.080
Where's Tandoji and the others?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.840
Don't worry, we're
taking care of them.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.380
Maintain security alert.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.090
Stand by until we hear from Mr. Kagami.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.010
Has there been further contact with Mr. Kagami?

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:30.430
Negative. There's a strong magnetic field
emanating from inside the mountain.

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.020
We believe this is the cause.

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:35.190
The results are in for
the energy response.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.110
What is this?

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.570
Confirmation of an irregular magnetic field
from inside the mountain.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:45.030
It's converting to
a pyramid shape.

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:49.280
We believe we lost Miss Ruri's location
due to this irregular magnetic field.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:02.590
I feel a tremendous energy from
the core of the mountain, oni.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:08.890
I believe the whole mountain is feeding power
to the Dark Stone located in the mountain core, oni.

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:14.890
The pyramid shape elevates the energy from within.
That's why ancient civilizations worshiped it, oni.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.520
Most likely this is
another one of them, oni.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:23.360
So the ancient people were amplifying the power
of the Dark Stone to use it for something?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.650
<i>I founf her, oni!
It's Ruri, oni!</i>

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.080
Miss Ruri. Miss Ruri!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.410
Miss Ruri!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.670
K-Kagami.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:45.050
Are you hurt?
Are you in any pain?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.590
I-I'm OK.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.220
Where's Alma?

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.510
It appears he fell into
this cave with you.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.270
But we don't know his location.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:56.520
No, that can't be.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:59.600
He can't transform without me.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.520
Let's locate him immediately.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.070
This mountain is more than--

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.200
Oni!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.160
The entrance!

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:28.970
Dark Stone?

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.300
Most likely.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:32.720
But don't worry.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:37.060
I won't let anything
happen to you.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:42.860
Outta my way!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.490
You pesky roach!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.460
I sense it.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.500
It's much stronger than before.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.610
I will protect you, Miss Ruri!

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:28.190
I will!

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.470
Kagami! Hurry!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.300
If you maximize the output,
we can break through this wall.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.800
Not in this cramped space.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:00.890
Even if we can break this wall,
the blast will get you, Miss Ruri.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.200
Kagami!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:16.740
Don't worry about me.
Hurry, use the Corundum laser!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.620
Hurry!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:41.390
Makoto, you know for generations, the Kagami family
has been appointed to serve the Aiba family.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:42.930
Yes, father.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:03.830
By any means...

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.710
I must...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.790
protect Miss Ruri!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.720
Ka-Kagami!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:35.820
If I tweak the output of the laser, I can hit
just the wall without injuring to Miss Ruri.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.820
There's only one shot for this.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.030
There's no room for failure.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.500
Hey, you in there?

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:56.670
What is this?

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.640
Oni!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.850
Ruri is right above us, oni.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.690
That Dark Stone,
it's trying to eat Ruri, oni.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:11.520
Alma!

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.690
You're there.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.860
Yeah, I'm here to help!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.530
Alma's also being attacked.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.040
Hurry, he needs my power!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.620
Leave it to me!

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:32.920
Tandoji! I can't blast this
stone wall with my power level.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.050
The Suit only has
a few minutes left!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:37.380
I can create a small gap
for a split second.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.550
When you see the opening,
grab the gem from Miss Ruri.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.470
Got it!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.100
B-But Kagami, we don't have a gem.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:45.930
Oh, yes we do.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:48.730
Right here!

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.440
Tandoji!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.530
Don't drop it!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:06.370
Your memories I take into me.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:11.000
You.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:16.420
Alma!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.730
My Soul...

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:34.060
I give to you!

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:40.940
Let's go!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.450
Be careful, oni. They're still
inside, don't hurt them--

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.660
I know.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.370
What?

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.750
The power to cut with precision!

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:30.870
Alma?

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:32.330
Alma!

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.520
So Wakana, you didn't
have a chance to swim?

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:56.190
That's too bad, you even remembered
to bring your school bathing suit.

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:57.520
I know, I know.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:01.690
But the stones were so beautiful
I didn't have time to do anything else.

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:04.030
What? You chose stones
over the ocean?

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.240
Tandoji, I failed this time.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:14.040
If you hadn't been there, I wouldn't have
been able to protect Miss Ruri.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.790
No sweat, nobody
got hurt, after all.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:17.580
Right.

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.090
That aside, Tandoji!

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:25.510
You said I didn't need to tell you...
That you would protect Miss Ruri.

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:29.850
As soon as we get back,
we'll begin your special training.

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:30.640
Huh?

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:33.220
To ensure you never make
the same mistake again.

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:35.730
We'll beat you into shape.

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:38.060
Get ready.

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:41.900
What? This is
the thanks I get?
